@startuml "Webhook Stripe Payment Succeeded - Diagramme de séquence"

title Traitement du webhook Stripe - Payment Succeeded

participant "Stripe API" as Stripe
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Webhook Handler" as WebhookHandler
participant "Payment Service" as PaymentSvc
participant "Order Service" as OrderSvc
participant "Ticket Service" as TicketSvc
participant "Queue Service\n(Bull/Redis)" as Queue
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Webhook Stripe - Payment Succeeded ==
note over Stripe: Événement asynchrone après confirmation
Stripe -> API: POST /api/webhook/stripe
note right: Event: payment_intent.succeeded
API -> WebhookHandler: processStripeWebhook(event, signature)
WebhookHandler -> WebhookHandler: Verify webhook signature
WebhookHandler -> Stripe: Verify webhook authenticity

alt Webhook authentique
    WebhookHandler -> PaymentSvc: handlePaymentSucceeded(payment_intent)
    PaymentSvc -> DB: SELECT payment WHERE stripePaymentId=?
    DB --> PaymentSvc: payment data
    
    PaymentSvc -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    PaymentSvc -> DB: UPDATE payments SET status='completed', processedAt=NOW()
    
    PaymentSvc -> OrderSvc: markOrderAsPaid(orderId)
    OrderSvc -> DB: UPDATE orders SET status='paid', paidAt=NOW()
    
    OrderSvc -> TicketSvc: activateOrderTickets(orderId)
    TicketSvc -> DB: UPDATE tickets SET status='paid' WHERE orderId=?
    
    PaymentSvc -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    
    ' Queue jobs asynchrones
    PaymentSvc -> Queue: addJob('generate-tickets', {orderId})
    PaymentSvc -> Queue: addJob('send-confirmation-email', {orderId})
    PaymentSvc -> Queue: addJob('update-analytics', {orderId})
    
    PaymentSvc --> WebhookHandler: payment processed
    WebhookHandler --> API: 200 OK
    API --> Stripe: webhook acknowledged
    
else Webhook non authentique
    WebhookHandler --> API: 401 Unauthorized
    API --> Stripe: webhook rejected
end

@enduml